"难怪我闻到了更多氧气！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"}],"DINO_2_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"This epoch is known for its unusual lifeforms, User Dave.","zh":"用户戴夫，这个纪元以其不寻常的生命形式而闻名。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"I know! Gymnosperms, right?","zh":"我懂了！裸子植物，对不对？"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I was thinking more in terms of saurians, User Dave. Dinosaurs.","zh":"用户戴夫，我更多是在指蜥形纲动物。恐龙。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"They won't attack us directly and we can't affect them.","zh":"它们不会直接攻击我们，我们也没办法干涉它们。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"However, they will definitely react to zombies. Be wary!","zh":"但是，它们肯定会对僵尸有所反应。多加小心！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}],"DINO_6_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"I can feel the ground a-trembling, Penny! More dinos?","zh":"我感觉地面都在颤动，潘妮！更多恐龙要来了？"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Indeed, User Dave. A herd of stegosaurs approaches.","zh":"确实，用户戴夫。一群剑龙正在接近。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"My sensors indicate they will snare zombies with their tail, and then flick them off.","zh":"我的传感器显示，它们将用尾部缠绕僵尸，随后将其弹射出去。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"That's what I would do!","zh":"我也会这么做！"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Short"}],"DINO_8_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I have analyzed a new plant, User Dave.","zh":"我已经分析了一株新植物，用户戴夫。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"The Perfume-shroom charms dinosaurs and turns them against the zombies.","zh":"香水菇能魅惑恐龙，让它们调头去攻击僵尸。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Dino-sour power? On OUR side? This is taco-level great news!","zh":"恐龙之力？为我们所用？这真是个玉米卷级的好消息！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"}],"DINO_9_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Penny! I just remembered how much I love silent letters!","zh":"潘妮！我刚刚想起来我有多喜欢单词里不发音的字母！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Coincidentally, User Dave, a flock of Pterodactyls is approaching.","zh":"说来也巧，用户戴夫，一群翼龙正在向我们接近。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Pterodactyls? That's ptotally pterrific!","zh":"翼龙？那真是龙重欢迎！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"}],"DINO_15_OUTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Look, Penny! A fresh star-hunky!","zh":"快看，潘妮！一个新鲜的大星星！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"A meteorite. Curious. My records indicate this should be... bigger.","zh":"一颗陨石。有点意思。我的记录显示，它本应……更大一些。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":" Bigger? Like, super burrito-sized?","zh":"更大？像是超级玉米卷那么大吗？"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"More like super Seattle-sized. I hope history has not gone awry...","zh":"得有一座西雅图城那么大吧。我希望历史没有出错……"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}]},"ui":{}}
